/-!
# Candidate-A spectral-cut atlas generated by intrinsic references

The preferred Candidate-A family-index packet supplies one actual reduced
family and one selected reference, namely the reference used by the circle
Quillen chart.  This file enlarges that datum to a family of spectral-cut or
parametrix references.

Every chart is an honest Mellin/zeta family whose connection coefficient is
identified with the intrinsic actual-minus-reference logarithmic trace.  The
selected chart is required to be exactly the already anchored Candidate-A
family.  Therefore the newly generated atlas retains the same H14 basepoint,
circle clutching and Quillen holonomy while deriving all other transitions
from reference-change traces.
-/

